    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0733" n="719" xml:id="pg719"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Policy Planning Staff Files: Lot 64D563<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d461-f1"/></note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-02-03">February 3, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At the Cabinet meeting this morning the President asked me to present the
                    question of recognizing the Governments of Laos, Cambodia and Viet Nam, and this
                    I did, giving the background and general appraisal of the situation.</p>
                <p>The President then asked for the opinion of each member of the Cabinet. All
                    members present believed that the only possible course was to proceed with
                    recognition although they fully realized the hazards involved.</p>
                <p>After considering the advice of the Cabinet, the President directed me to proceed
                    in accordance with our recommendation to him.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>D[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ean</hi>] A[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >cheson</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
